---
// Word in, function, new word out, chained.
---
<figure class="illus">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 84" role="img" aria-labelledby="idea-art-t">
    <title id="idea-art-t">The word 食べる goes into a function called tai and comes out as 食べたい, which goes into a function called neg and comes out as 食べたくない.</title>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="5" y="8" width="80" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="45" y="28">食べる</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M87 28H98" /><path class="il-ah" d="M105 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-mach" x="105" y="14" width="46" height="28" rx="6" />
    <text class="il-t il-m" x="128" y="28">tai</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M153 28H162" /><path class="il-ah" d="M171 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="171" y="8" width="100" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="221" y="28">食べたい</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M273 28H282" /><path class="il-ah" d="M291 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-mach" x="291" y="14" width="46" height="28" rx="6" />
    <text class="il-t il-m" x="314" y="28">neg</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M339 28H348" /><path class="il-ah" d="M357 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="357" y="8" width="118" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="416" y="28">食べたくない</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="45" y="72">word</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="128" y="72">function</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="221" y="72">new word</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="314" y="72">function</text>
    <text class="il-t il-s" x="416" y="72">new word</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Word in, new word out. Feed the result into the next function.</figcaption>
</figure>
